    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d43">

                <pb facs="0184" n="66" sameAs="frus:frus1889/pg66"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Blaine to Mr. Adams.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-11-30"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 30,
                        1889</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Adams was instructed that so soon as a majority of the people of Brazil
                    should have signified their assent to the establishment and maintenance of the
                    Republic he was to give it, on behalf of the United States, a formal and cordial
                    recognition.</p>
            </div>
